async function advisorWorkflowRefresh(recommendationId=advisorG2State.workflowRecommendationId){const box=$('advisorWorkflowStatus'),features=await g2RuntimeFeatures();if(!features?.advisorWorkflow){box.className='advisor-workflow-status review_required';box.textContent='Abrí Radar con INICIAR_RADAR_G2_PHASE8E.bat para habilitar Recommendation Workflow.';return null}if(!recommendationId){box.className='advisor-workflow-status';box.textContent='Seleccioná una recomendación.';return null}advisorG2State.workflowRecommendationId=recommendationId;try{const f=await advisorJson('/api/g2/advisor/recommendations/freshness?id='+encodeURIComponent(recommendationId));box.className='advisor-workflow-status '+String(f.status||'').toLowerCase();$('advisorEngineStatus').textContent='G2 8E · Workflow '+String(f.status||'N/D');$('advisorEngineStatus').className=f.status==='CURRENT'?'intel-chip good':f.status==='EXPIRED'?'intel-chip bad':'intel-chip warn';box.innerHTML=`<b>${escapeHtml(f.status||'N/D')} · ${f.canAccept?'Puede ACCEPT':'No puede ACCEPT'}</b><div>Edad ${Number(f.ageHours||0).toFixed(1)}h / ventana ${Number(f.maxAgeHours||0).toFixed(0)}h · Review ${escapeHtml(f.latestReviewStatus||'N/D')} · Snapshot latest ${escapeHtml(f.latestOpportunitySnapshotId||'N/D')}</div><div class="advisor-note">${escapeHtml((f.checks||[]).filter(c=>!c.passed).map(c=>c.code).join(', ')||'Sin flags de frescura.')}</div>`;return f}catch(e){box.className='advisor-workflow-status review_required';box.textContent=String(e.message||e);throw e}}
